                                                "sense_id": "3f48d65b-3453-327b-9036-caaab7803293",
                                                "text": "In early times it was common to charge the reset of property taken by robbery as reset of theft. But in later practice reset of property taken by robbery has been frequently libelled and found relevant (1)."
